---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About — Lenny Chen"
  description="Lenny Chen is a technical documentarian focused on infrastructure software products, currently working on docs.temporal.io."
>
  <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[var(--color-heading)]">About</h1>
  <div class="prose mt-6 max-w-none">
    <p>
      My name is Lenny, and I'm a technical documentarian with a bias toward infra-focused software products. Currently working on docs.temporal.io.
      I am passionate about learning new things, quick to help others, and love the feeling of being proud of something I made.
    </p>
    <p>
      Outside of work, my favorite pastimes include portrait and food photography, being a cat dad, overly complicated board games, and going to fancy restaurants with friends while pretending it's our anniversary to get a free cake.
      I also consume a lot of media: books, TV shows, video games, and films. I love a good story no matter the form.
    </p>
    <p>
      Since 2024, I've been reviewing every single film I watch on <a href="https://letterboxd.com/lennessy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[var(--color-link)] hover:text-[var(--color-link-hover)] underline transition-colors">Letterboxd</a>. I think I have great taste. If you are a big cinephile yourself, you should give me a follow and let's talk about movies. If you only go occasionally, feel free to check <a href="/reviews" class="text-[var(--color-link)] hover:text-[var(--color-link-hover)] underline transition-colors">here</a> to see how I liked a movie before you decide whether you should see it.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
